---
import '../../../styles/global.css';
---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
    <meta name="description" content="The HALO Method ZenBid integration endpoint reference." />
    <title>ZenBid Integration API | The HALO Method</title>
  </head>
  <body class="min-h-screen bg-dark-bg text-white">
    <main class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-6 py-16">
      <a href="/" class="text-cyan-glow hover:text-white">Back to The HALO Method</a>
      <section class="mt-10 rounded-2xl border border-cyan-glow/20 bg-dark-surface p-8">
        <p class="mb-3 text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-cyan-glow">Integration</p>
        <h1 class="text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight">ZenBid API endpoints</h1>
        <p class="mt-5 max-w-2xl text-gray-300">
          These legacy endpoints remain available for integration testing while the public HALO Method site focuses on HALO.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-8 grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2">
          <a class="rounded-lg border border-cyan-glow/20 p-4 text-cyan-glow hover:bg-cyan-glow/10" href="/api/zenbid/test?type=overview">Overview test</a>
          <a class="rounded-lg border border-cyan-glow/20 p-4 text-cyan-glow hover:bg-cyan-glow/10" href="/api/zenbid/test?type=search">Agent search test</a>
          <a class="rounded-lg border border-cyan-glow/20 p-4 text-cyan-glow hover:bg-cyan-glow/10" href="/api/zenbid/test?type=booking">Booking flow test</a>
          <a class="rounded-lg border border-cyan-glow/20 p-4 text-cyan-glow hover:bg-cyan-glow/10" href="/api/zenbid/test?type=webhook">Webhook flow test</a>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>

